  "reference": "https://gitlab.com/librespacefoundation/satnogs/satnogs-decoders/-/blob/master/ksy/geoscan.ksy",
  "note": "BEACON layout is taken from the SatNOGS geoscan.ksy and checked against 2 frames of a real IQ recording (2026-11-11): battery 2x3.9 V, VBUS 7.9 V, temperatures and RSSI are physically plausible. GNSS-42/43 follow the same ksy (and the verified Lobachevsky layout) but no GNSS frame has been received yet. cw_frames: the CW beacon has no published specification (SatNOGS has no CW decoder for Geoscan); the token names and their meanings are inferred from one decoded pass (IQ recording 2026-11-10, ~13 WPM) by comparison with the 9k6 BEACON values, and every label is marked inferred.",
